<title>JAPAN: Osaka Stadium files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Osaka Stadium files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stadium operator Osaka Stadium Co Ltd said on Tuesday it had applied the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 20 billion yen worth of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The registration will be effective for two years from May 16, it said.</p>
